{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56308","headline":"大桐军行 · 李斌","name":"大桐军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驱马出关城，孤舟边思盈。\n风传万里去，目末两乡情。\n北望单于道，[东临]（临东）大武营。\n塞阙烁𧣹合，山浮夜泉明\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李斌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}